cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its design, please cite it as below."
title: "Greenwashing Detection — a Graph-RAG system over a temporal ESG knowledge graph"
abstract: >-
  A Graph-RAG pipeline for detecting greenwashing in Vietnamese listed companies in the
  construction, building-materials and real-estate sector. ESG statements from annual
  reports (the claim side) and independent news coverage (the conduct side) are classified,
  reduced to typed KPI observations and temporal triples, and resolved into a single
  temporal ESG knowledge graph, so a company's reported claims can be cross-checked against
  its observed conduct with sentence-level provenance. The system deliberately emits
  evidence and an advisory assessment rather than a greenwashing score, because no
  ground-truth label exists for this corpus.
type: software
